# Belerick, Guard of Nature

> Belerick is a punishment tank, not a universal frontliner. Pick him when the enemy damage plan must hit your body many times before it reaches your carries. If the lobby is built around long-range poke, true damage, or instant backline dives, he becomes a slow tree walking into the wrong storm.

